        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The barrier layer restricts wetting of the base alloy by molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The barrier layer restricts dissolution of the base alloy into molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have lower erosion rates and greater molten-aluminum corrosion resistance than the conventional material.",
